  "question": {
    "text": "Two spherical bodies of the same mass <math><mi>M</mi></math>, are moving with velocities <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math>and <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>&nbsp;respectively, along the same line. These bodies collide perfectly inelastically and head-on. The loss in kinetic energy is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
